    ],
    "reading_order": 19,
    "text": "From the example above, you might have noticed that HCF(6, 20) × LCM(6, 20)\n= 6 × 20. In fact, we can verify that for any two positive integers a and b,\nHCF (a, b) × LCM (a, b) = a × b. We can use this result to find the LCM of two\npositive integers, if we have already found the HCF of the two positive integers.",
    "latex": null,
